#
# Extra blacklist for the macOS package, applied on top of Craft's default one.
# Entries are regular expressions matched against the path inside the image.

# LV2 plugin bundles. A .lv2 "bundle" is a plain directory of .ttl files and a
# shared object — a convention from the LV2 spec, unrelated to macOS bundles.
# codesign --deep walks Contents/Frameworks, decides these directories are
# subcomponents, and stops with "bundle format unrecognized, invalid, or
# unsuitable", which fails the whole .dmg.
#
# Nothing is lost by leaving them out: this application's flatpak build already
# compiles MLT with -DUSE_LV2=OFF, so LV2 audio plugins are not a feature we
# ship on any platform. Craft's MLT is built with LV2 on and drags lilv, serd,
# sord and sratom in as a side effect; excluding the data here keeps the binary
# cache hit that building MLT ourselves would throw away.
lib/lv2/.*
